      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "92",
        "41098003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54027712829079de20d29a0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看见路了！前进吧☆我的幸运之路",
      "source_fingerprint": "acc024503237171ff5491fbb48764b87721cc4bfeeed2ff9d84e7882c98d1f65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "92",
        "41098004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc34a83e1c31b95166f35464",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的运气☆就交给历奇吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fb5dbe1939ba1b7aced65b7cf72500e095169c2d543740538d5c813f2f7f0c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "92",
        "41098005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a44a1380f5b72f0e0154cf6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "弱点！？你所教给我的东西",
      "source_fingerprint": "30399bb7753b39a28a0e620b1cf4650d5a9e57a0f66c447a790bb16d2683d710",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "92",
        "41098006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6a15530c6c5316b4ddab93a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向着梦想，径直前进☆你就是我的……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a0e8151cf2695f5be355787ed372f7ab8e817eaa438b8805d77e0eab58bb436",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "92",
        "41098007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f58f244929c8d470a5b5bb4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "♪从苫小牧飞来了",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0979246a4052f4202f9951a0d70039bbf2beb0387713ca5b2b62c79dc63914e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "92",
        "41099001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c62170a89bb7fe6ada71c96f",
